    "menu_item": "Must exactly match the title of a top-level menu item.",
    "mobile_image": "Optional. Shown instead of the desktop image on small screens.",
    "preview_video": "A short, silent clip that loops in place. Keep it a few seconds long.",
    "promo_position": "Which card slot the promo occupies, counting from the first product. Applies to the first page only.",
    "show_rating": "Reads the standard review metafields written by review apps (Judge.me, Loox, Yotpo, ...). Hidden for products without reviews.",
    "size_guide": "Shown as a link next to size options; the page opens in a dialog.",
    "swatch_colors": "Swatches use the colors set on product option values in your admin. For names without one, create a metaobject definition with type \"swatch_color\" and fields \"labels\" (single line text), \"color\" (color), and \"image\" (file) — entries match option and filter values by name.",
